  "notes": "SIMILAR WORDS:\n・{中止|ちゅうし}: Cancellation, stopping something (often permanent or indefinite)\n・{中断|ちゅうだん}: Interruption, temporary suspension (implies resumption later)\n・{延期|えんき}: Postponement (rescheduled for later)\n・{取|と}り{消|け}し: Cancellation, withdrawal (often for reservations, orders)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・〜が{中止|ちゅうし}になる (~ is/gets canceled)\n・〜を{中止|ちゅうし}する (to cancel ~)\n・{中止|ちゅうし}の{お知|しら}らせ (cancellation notice)",
